                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <p>
                        Humidity represents the amount of
                        water vapor present in the air.
                    </p>

                </div>

                `
            );

        }


        // =====================================
        // FEELS LIKE DETAILS
        // =====================================

        function showFeelsLikeDetails() {

            if (!currentWeather) {

                showError(
                    "Please search for a city first."
